{"chunk_id": "0b0f7da9cbd8", "text": "On the heights of the Himalayas, Arjuna is visited by the Lokapalas\u2014the guardians of the worlds\u2014who reveal his divine origin and future destiny. Yama declares that Arjuna was once the ancient sage Nara and foretells his role in the coming war: he will defeat mighty warriors such as Bhishma, Karna, and many incarnated demons. Each deity then grants him powerful celestial weapons. Yama gives an irresistible mace, Varuna offers his binding nooses, and Kubera bestows the Antarddhana weapon capable of overwhelming enemies. Finally, Indra announces that Arjuna must ascend to heaven to receive further divine arms. Awed by the assembled gods, Arjuna worships them and rejoices in the success of his ascetic quest as Indra\u2019s radiant chariot approaches.\nArjuna is blessed by the Lokapalas, receives powerful celestial weapons, learns of his divine origin and future victories, and is invited by Indra to ascend to heaven.\nThemes: divine revelation, celestial weapons, destiny and prophecy, divine parentage, preparation for war", "vector": [0.011559325270354748, -0.01672244630753994, -0.006617103703320026, 0.004958706442266703, -0.0035805553197860718, 0.026442037895321846, -0.031545814126729965, -0.0010797715513035655, -0.01502118818461895, -0.006511599291115999, -0.0006870149518363178, -0.0027431142516434193, 0.0035146151203662157, -0.0009009086061269045, -0.010510874912142754, 0.017685173079371452, 0.048136379569768906, -0.020612921565771103, 0.014546418562531471, -0.01006248127669096, -0.01495524775236845, -0.002418358577415347, 0.004533391911536455, 0.012924288399517536, -0.013280365616083145, 0.016893891617655754, 0.026257405057549477, -0.03560773283243179, 0.012522052973508835, -0.018990790471434593, -0.0062808082439005375, 0.007009448017925024, -0.002927746856585145, -0.0037552970461547375, -0.02551887556910515, 0.007873265072703362, 0.004668569192290306, -0.02294720523059368, 0.008763458579778671, 0.008921715430915356, 0.